<h2 id="org6527bdb">Equations</h2>
<div class="outline-text-2" id="text-org6527bdb">
<div class="math-prose"><p>
An inline formula: \(a^2 + b^2 = c^2\). Another example: \(\lim_{n \to \infty} 1/n = 0\).
</p>

</div>
<div class="math-prose"><p>
A displayed integral:
</p>

</div>
<div class="math-prose"><p>
\[
\int_0^1 x^2\,\mathrm{d}x = \frac{1}{3}.
\]
</p>

</div>
<div class="math-prose"><p>
A multi-line calculation:
</p>

</div>
<div class="math-prose"><p>
\[\begin{aligned}
\sum_{k=1}^{n} k &= \frac{n(n+1)}{2}, \\
\sum_{k=1}^{n} k^2 &= \frac{n(n+1)(2n+1)}{6}.
\end{aligned}\]
</p>

</div>
